units metal
dimension 3
atom_style atomic
boundary p p f
read_data structures/after_hit6_total_1ps_cool_17226.data
create_atoms 4 single 46.1830000000 27.3890000000 60.0 units box
include potentials/potential_stage69.inc
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
region fixed_region block INF INF INF INF -10.0 8.0 units box
region sink_region block INF INF INF INF 8.0 25.0 units box
region crater_region cylinder z 45.0 26.9 8.0 25.0 100.0 units box
group substrate id 1:17226
group new_projectile id 17227
group projectiles id 17221:17226
group all_projectiles union projectiles new_projectile
group fixed region fixed_region
group sink region sink_region
group mobile subtract all fixed
group crater region crater_region
group freezone intersect mobile crater
group free_substrate subtract freezone all_projectiles
group anchored subtract mobile freezone
group bath subtract sink all_projectiles
velocity new_projectile set 0.0 0.0 -105.3164
fix hold fixed setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0
fix integrate all nve
fix anchor anchored spring/self 100.0
fix_modify anchor energy yes
fix bathfix bath langevin 300.0 300.0 0.05 821010 zero yes tally yes
compute Tfree free_substrate temp
compute Tmobile mobile temp
timestep 0.00005
thermo 500
thermo_style custom step time atoms c_Tfree c_Tmobile pe ke etotal f_bathfix
thermo_modify flush yes
dump tr all custom 1000 dumps/impact_07_62eV.dump id type x y z vx vy vz fx fy fz
dump_modify tr sort id
run 5000
undump tr
write_data structures/after_hit7_17227.data
write_restart structures/after_hit7_17227.restart
